	(text "HDDSynthPro: a PGA2350 (RP2350B) that acts as an IDE hard disk.\nPages: power and USB; the PGA2350 with the activity link and LEDs; the IDE bus switches and header; the microSD socket.\nNets cross pages through global labels. The GPIO map must agree with src/config.h and docs/wiring.md:\nrun hardware/tools/check_netlist.py after editing."
